WEBVTT

00:08.870 --> 00:10.030
It came out!

00:10.030 --> 00:11.110
You're kidding.

00:17.750 --> 00:20.500
I'm so glad to have my spear back.

00:22.020 --> 00:23.390
Leviatan, behind you!

00:31.350 --> 00:33.270
The holy ground of pillars,

00:34.020 --> 00:36.100
located in a hidden place.

00:37.460 --> 00:40.780
The few serving the gods,

00:41.860 --> 00:44.160
together with the holy ground,

00:45.130 --> 00:49.430
serving for generations as protectors.

02:18.160 --> 02:19.030
Leviatan!

02:20.560 --> 02:21.530
That's...

02:22.190 --> 02:23.520
A Lucasite!

02:23.100 --> 02:27.450
It's Definitely Suspicious!

03:32.680 --> 03:34.190
My spear...

03:34.850 --> 03:36.010
Good...

03:37.690 --> 03:39.860
Girls, protect Leviatan!

03:40.070 --> 03:40.990
Leave it to me!

03:48.270 --> 03:51.610
We'll never make any progress like this!

03:57.840 --> 03:58.990
Hey, someone!

03:58.990 --> 04:00.210
Stop him!

04:00.600 --> 04:02.090
I'll take care of it!

04:04.530 --> 04:05.590
Nice!

04:30.410 --> 04:31.500
Leviatan!

04:32.400 --> 04:33.330
Now!

04:40.860 --> 04:42.460
What's wrong, Levi-tan?

04:55.260 --> 04:57.480
How pathetic.

04:58.080 --> 05:00.860
I was hoping it would defeat them...

05:01.330 --> 05:04.360
I thought it would be a
little more useful...

05:35.270 --> 05:36.640
Are you awake?

05:37.230 --> 05:38.810
Thank goodness...

05:44.680 --> 05:45.740
Where am I?

05:46.390 --> 05:47.930
Do not push yourself too hard yet.

05:47.930 --> 05:50.120
You'll reopen your wounds.

05:51.430 --> 05:52.720
Who are you?

05:54.410 --> 05:56.030
My name is Heqet.

05:56.030 --> 05:58.130
I work at this temple.

05:58.130 --> 06:00.380
She saved all of us.

06:01.300 --> 06:04.210
I see. We...

06:19.060 --> 06:20.230
This way.

06:21.730 --> 06:22.730
Everyone!

06:22.730 --> 06:23.650
Yeah!

06:36.590 --> 06:37.410
My spear!

06:38.250 --> 06:39.550
Where is my spear?

06:42.000 --> 06:44.280
If you hadn't protected us,

06:44.280 --> 06:46.690
I don't know what would have happened.

06:47.170 --> 06:48.170
Thank you.

06:48.760 --> 06:50.560
No need to thank me.

06:54.630 --> 06:56.000
Are you all right, Heqet?

06:56.000 --> 06:58.380
Yes. I just need to rest a little...

06:58.380 --> 07:01.440
Keeping up the barrier must
use a lot of stamina.

07:01.970 --> 07:04.840
You said you work at this temple.

07:04.840 --> 07:06.440
Are you a priestess?

07:06.810 --> 07:11.560
Yes. My family has served
here for generations.

07:11.560 --> 07:14.360
Your family? Where are the others?

07:17.100 --> 07:19.820
I am currently protecting
this place alone.

07:19.820 --> 07:21.750
What? All by yourself?

07:22.880 --> 07:26.940
But someday, I will pledge
myself to the good lords,

07:26.940 --> 07:29.700
and must choose a successor.

07:30.130 --> 07:31.760
I must, but...

07:32.940 --> 07:34.460
Meeting someone...

07:35.890 --> 07:37.490
You don't meet many people?

07:39.010 --> 07:40.560
It is a serious problem.

07:40.800 --> 07:43.280
I guess it's a little tough living in here.

07:43.280 --> 07:46.450
Protecting the temple is my job.

07:46.450 --> 07:48.780
I cannot leave this place.

07:49.110 --> 07:50.570
Protect...

07:51.220 --> 07:53.870
We need to do something
about that monster quickly!

07:56.080 --> 07:59.290
I put up a barrier, so this place is safe.

07:59.600 --> 08:02.770
Why did you come to a place with a monster?

08:02.770 --> 08:05.790
We came without knowing
the Lucasite was here.

08:05.790 --> 08:08.750
We're the Aquafall Defense.

08:09.700 --> 08:11.270
"We"?

08:11.270 --> 08:14.390
Your only two members are
Syrorin and Jörm, right?

08:16.800 --> 08:18.510
What?!

08:18.860 --> 08:23.020
In other words, are you saying you
can defeat that evil creature?

08:24.690 --> 08:28.020
Well, we hope to someday...

08:28.820 --> 08:31.930
I see. Please listen, then.

08:31.930 --> 08:34.030
It happened a month ago.

08:35.160 --> 08:39.240
It began when the floating islands pouring holy water into the spring...

08:39.240 --> 08:41.660
...fell to the ground.

08:42.050 --> 08:48.190
The life in the area was extinguished by
the insects released by the evil creature.

08:48.190 --> 08:52.010
The spring said to exist since the
creation of the world dried up.

08:52.510 --> 08:58.150
Does that mean this area became
a desert because of that Lucasite?

08:59.530 --> 09:04.670
This holy place has been known since
ancient times as the Keystone of Aquafall.

09:05.020 --> 09:07.740
Our ancestors treated this place as a temple,

09:07.740 --> 09:10.390
and we have protected it for generations.

09:10.910 --> 09:13.030
What's here?

09:13.440 --> 09:17.070
Unfortunately, that was not passed down.

09:17.070 --> 09:20.820
The history of this holy place is unclear.

09:20.820 --> 09:24.010
What? Why don't you know
something so important?

09:25.820 --> 09:27.080
It wasn't me!

09:27.690 --> 09:29.910
Suspicious, suspicious, suspicious!

09:32.960 --> 09:36.170
I do not have much, but come with me.

09:42.380 --> 09:43.930
It's delicious.

09:44.350 --> 09:47.130
And it feels very nostalgic.

09:47.130 --> 09:48.560
Is this water?

09:48.740 --> 09:51.700
It is water from the spring
flowing from this temple.

09:51.700 --> 09:53.740
No wonder it's so good.

09:53.740 --> 09:56.070
But didn't the spring dry up?

09:56.240 --> 09:59.590
Yes. I had drawn that water previously.

09:59.590 --> 10:01.830
This is all that is left.

10:01.830 --> 10:03.290
What?

10:03.290 --> 10:04.830
Just this?

10:05.160 --> 10:06.830
Yes, this is all.

10:07.550 --> 10:08.900
We're sorry!

10:10.090 --> 10:11.740
Do not worry about it.

10:11.740 --> 10:15.290
It was drunk by people who remembered
the flavor of the spring.

10:15.290 --> 10:15.840
All is well.

10:16.110 --> 10:19.170
But what will you do without water?

10:19.170 --> 10:21.440
Wh-What are we going to do?

10:22.450 --> 10:24.480
I'll try summoning some.

10:24.480 --> 10:25.100
What?

10:25.380 --> 10:30.040
But you just used your magic,
and you're still hurt...

10:30.040 --> 10:33.230
It's all right. I'm a water user.

10:36.660 --> 10:40.240
Water, please. Come to me.

10:40.900 --> 10:42.580
Fill this jug.

11:11.980 --> 11:13.780
Are you okay, Levi-tan?

11:15.920 --> 11:18.520
Good work, Leviatan. You did it.

11:19.880 --> 11:23.950
Amazing. You can summon water...

11:24.470 --> 11:26.610
This is the most I can do right now.

11:27.010 --> 11:27.950
I'm sorry.

11:27.950 --> 11:31.250
No, I am sorry for pushing you too hard.

11:31.250 --> 11:34.820
But won't you run out again
immediately with only that much?

11:34.820 --> 11:36.940
Let's leave this temple together.

11:36.940 --> 11:38.960
Oh, right. That's what we should do.

11:39.360 --> 11:41.420
I appreciate your thoughtfulness.

11:41.420 --> 11:43.710
However, I cannot leave this place.

11:43.710 --> 11:45.220
Why not?

11:45.620 --> 11:49.000
Protecting the temple is a priestess's job.

11:49.430 --> 11:54.200
No matter what happens,
I cannot leave this place.

11:54.560 --> 11:56.730
But this place is dangerous.

11:56.730 --> 11:59.030
There's a monster right in front of you.

11:59.500 --> 12:03.560
All the more reason I must
continue protecting this place.

12:04.360 --> 12:06.950
But by yourself...

12:07.240 --> 12:10.160
Do not worry. I am a priestess.

12:10.160 --> 12:13.430
My life is tied to this temple.

12:13.430 --> 12:16.960
Don't prepare yourself for that.

12:16.960 --> 12:18.830
You're making it sound
like you can't be saved.

12:18.830 --> 12:21.470
What a kind fairy.

12:21.780 --> 12:24.420
Why is that monster here?

12:26.230 --> 12:29.020
This is an ancient holy place.

12:29.020 --> 12:31.980
There must be something here...

12:32.630 --> 12:35.650
This holy place, the keystone of the planet...

12:36.620 --> 12:39.650
Why was my spear there?

12:39.910 --> 12:43.980
Your spear suddenly appeared
on the altar last night.

12:43.980 --> 12:48.240
I attempted to inspect the spear,
but I could not remove it.

12:48.740 --> 12:50.210
That's right.

12:50.210 --> 12:52.560
Not even I could pull it out.

12:52.560 --> 12:54.470
There might be something
weird about that.

12:56.890 --> 13:01.670
Since you were able to remove it,
you may be special.

13:02.090 --> 13:03.850
I don't know if I'm special...

13:04.440 --> 13:06.180
But it doesn't make sense.

13:06.730 --> 13:11.060
This spear disappeared,
stuck in a monster's eye.

13:11.520 --> 13:16.020
We pursued the monster
to take back the spear.

13:16.020 --> 13:18.190
What was it doing stuck in the altar?

13:18.780 --> 13:22.500
Did someone put it there
for some purpose?

13:22.500 --> 13:25.190
Or could there be something
about this spear?

13:26.180 --> 13:31.200
That spear does seem to
have a will of its own...

13:31.500 --> 13:36.610
But that boy was the one who
told us to go to the desert.

13:36.610 --> 13:39.710
We wouldn't have come here if not for that.

13:39.990 --> 13:43.260
I haven't met that kid, so I
don't know anything about him.

13:43.260 --> 13:45.160
Does he seem suspicious?

13:45.160 --> 13:47.260
Well, when you put it that way...

13:47.650 --> 13:49.930
He seems like a normal boy.

13:50.260 --> 13:52.000
Yeah, he's normal.

13:53.440 --> 13:54.930
Is he really normal?

13:58.540 --> 14:02.220
This spear of mine and that boy...

14:02.700 --> 14:06.180
Could there be some special
meaning, Onii-chan?

14:07.320 --> 14:09.830
It will be dawn soon.

14:09.830 --> 14:12.300
You should leave before it becomes hot.

14:12.300 --> 14:16.040
If you use the hidden passage,
you can safely escape outside.

14:17.120 --> 14:19.520
Does your wound still hurt?

14:20.150 --> 14:21.810
Yes, a little...

14:22.290 --> 14:23.550
But I'm fine.

14:23.850 --> 14:26.550
I only treated you with first aid.

14:26.870 --> 14:28.590
Do not push yourself too hard.

14:29.110 --> 14:30.220
Thank you.

14:30.980 --> 14:32.440
This way.

14:34.770 --> 14:36.770
Up ahead, go left.

14:36.770 --> 14:39.140
Go up at the end.

14:46.020 --> 14:47.670
Be careful.

14:49.910 --> 14:53.260
Sorry for slowing everyone down.

14:53.260 --> 14:54.710
There's no need to be so formal.

14:54.710 --> 14:56.310
Don't worry about it.

14:56.820 --> 14:59.460
This was supposed to be my vacation,

14:59.460 --> 15:01.360
but it turned into a long journey.

15:01.760 --> 15:04.550
You'll pay me for our journey
through the desert, right?

15:04.790 --> 15:05.630
No.

15:05.630 --> 15:06.720
Why not?

15:06.720 --> 15:09.570
If anything, you should give me a bonus!

15:09.570 --> 15:12.710
I didn't come to the desert on vacation.

15:12.710 --> 15:14.280
What?!

15:17.390 --> 15:19.220
Up at the end.

15:21.790 --> 15:23.230
It must be this hole.

16:06.620 --> 16:08.730
I can't believe it's changed so much...

16:10.790 --> 16:14.240
It must be hard for Kero-chan
being born a priestess.

16:15.130 --> 16:16.440
Kero-chan?

16:16.780 --> 16:18.600
That was her name, right?

16:18.600 --> 16:19.740
Heqet!

16:19.740 --> 16:21.870
Oh, Heqet...

16:22.200 --> 16:23.930
What's wrong with Kero-chan?

16:23.930 --> 16:26.310
Your memory is unbelievably awful.

16:26.310 --> 16:28.880
Your memories are just too good.

16:28.880 --> 16:30.130
No!

16:31.790 --> 16:34.240
I wonder if she'll be all right.

16:34.920 --> 16:38.110
She's only about as old as my little sisters.

16:38.110 --> 16:40.430
I'm worried about her being on her own.

16:40.430 --> 16:42.240
Let's go back and fight.

16:42.240 --> 16:44.650
You won't be able to defeat
it just because you want to.

16:45.570 --> 16:47.080
There he is!

16:47.080 --> 16:48.170
You...

16:48.730 --> 16:51.650
Is this the boy you've
been talking about?

16:52.220 --> 16:55.370
You told us the monster
had gone to the desert.

16:55.370 --> 16:56.660
Where is it?

16:56.970 --> 16:58.210
I don't know.

16:58.210 --> 17:00.820
But you've got your spear.

17:00.820 --> 17:02.160
You found it, didn't you?

17:02.390 --> 17:04.380
Yes, but...

17:04.380 --> 17:06.670
Oh? Are you hurt?

17:07.140 --> 17:09.990
Rajima Volcano isn't far from here.

17:09.990 --> 17:12.870
The hot springs there are
supposed to heal wounds.

17:12.870 --> 17:15.220
How kind of you to let us know.

17:15.220 --> 17:19.640
Anyway, what do you mean, we can't
defeat it just because we want to?

17:19.640 --> 17:21.180
What do you know?

17:21.820 --> 17:23.590
I know everything.

17:26.520 --> 17:27.910
Just kidding.

17:27.910 --> 17:31.880
But don't you think you'll
be stronger if you go?

17:31.880 --> 17:32.540
Look.

17:33.160 --> 17:35.120
It's north of here.

17:36.840 --> 17:38.950
What will happen if we go there?

17:39.240 --> 17:40.530
He's gone.

17:40.530 --> 17:41.970
He disappeared again.

17:41.970 --> 17:43.980
I see.

17:44.700 --> 17:47.460
He's more suspicious than you said.

17:49.690 --> 17:51.460
Let's go to Rajima Volcano.

17:51.460 --> 17:52.570
What?

17:52.570 --> 17:55.210
Wait, you believe him?

17:55.210 --> 17:57.170
Even though he's clearly suspicious?

17:57.170 --> 18:01.470
That's right. It's like
walking into a trap.

18:02.440 --> 18:03.770
Is it a trap?

18:04.210 --> 18:08.100
Just like that boy said,
I got my spear back.

18:08.360 --> 18:09.810
If it will make me stronger...

18:09.810 --> 18:12.210
If it will allow me to drive back
the Lucasite in the temple...

18:12.840 --> 18:14.110
I will go.

18:14.910 --> 18:17.950
I want to do something
about that Lucasite, too.

18:17.950 --> 18:19.680
I'll go with you.

18:19.680 --> 18:22.620
If Syrorin's going, I'll go, too.

18:24.200 --> 18:27.210
But you're injured.
There's something wrong with you.

18:27.630 --> 18:31.960
I guess we can't help it if we're going
to heal your wounds in the hot springs.

18:32.720 --> 18:37.330
Besides, I'd like to drink
water from this spring.

18:40.700 --> 18:44.860
Let's turn this place back into
the beautiful place it was.

18:45.770 --> 18:47.370
Let's do it for Kero-chan, too.

18:47.370 --> 18:48.260
Yeah.

18:49.750 --> 18:51.060
The bags!

18:51.060 --> 18:52.720
What are you doing?

18:52.720 --> 18:54.320
Those are my bags!

18:54.320 --> 18:55.350
Sorry!

18:55.350 --> 18:57.820
I'm subtracting this from your pay.

18:57.820 --> 18:59.350
What?

20:11.620 --> 20:19.380
Next Episode

20:14.540 --> 20:19.380
I'm Definitely Going to Take a Bath!
